it close to the chest. On March 13, Olivia’s website was updated with a brand new purple logo and font design, hinting at the potential aesthetic for the next album. The logo was soon spotted on murals, screens, and chalk designs across the world. On April 2, Rodrigo officially announced the album’s title, artwork, and release date via an Instagram post. On April 7, Rodrigo announced via social media that the lead single, “drop dead”, would be released on April 17.",
